# ───────── OS / editor ─────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.idea/
**/.idea/
*.iml
**/*.iml
.vscode/

# ───────── Local tooling (not part of the project) ─────────
.claude/
**/.claude/

# ───────── Flutter / Dart build artifacts (generated, large) ─────────
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/generated_plugin_registrant.*
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Pods/

# ───────── Internal working docs — never published ─────────
# Plans, backend correspondence, requirement/answer rounds and content drafts
# live on disk and stay there. This repo publishes the apps, not the notes
# behind them. README.md is the one document that ships.
/*.md
!/README.md
/customer-app/*.md
/admin-app/*.md
/content/
/backend-handoff/

# ───────── Secrets / machine-local config — NEVER commit ─────────
**/android/local.properties
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/Maps.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/.env
